{"id": "dev000-ja", "item_id": "dev000", "arch": "plan_execute", "type": "topic", "language": "ja", "law": "民法", "gold": ["740"], "anchor": [], "answer": "民法第 740 条（民法）は、婚姻届が法令に違反しない場合に受理されることを定めています。", "status": "answered", "score": {"cited": ["740"], "invalid": [], "gold_hit": true, "gold_recall": 1.0, "extra": [], "correct": true, "no_citation": false, "quotes": 0, "quotes_unsupported": 0}, "run": {"llm_calls": 4, "tool_calls": 1, "tokens_in": 2554, "tokens_out": 191, "tokens": 2745, "latency_s": 13.125872913999046, "errors": 0, "tool_failures": 0}, "calls": [{"node": "planner", "in": 112, "out": 71, "ms": 5367.156909000187}, {"node": "step.agent", "in": 965, "out": 54, "ms": 3837.1183599992946}, {"node": "step.agent", "in": 1315, "out": 38, "ms": 2025.8708179990208}, {"node": "synth", "in": 162, "out": 28, "ms": 1882.1144699995784}], "tools": [{"node": "step", "name": "search_articles", "args": {"query": "婚姻の届出の受理", "law": "民法", "top_k": 5}, "ok": true}], "verify": [], "errors": [], "prompts": "v2", "model": "qwen3.5:9b (Q4_K_M) via llama.cpp server"}
{"id": "dev000-en", "item_id": "dev000", "arch": "plan_execute", "type": "topic", "language": "en", "law": "民法", "gold": ["740"], "anchor": [], "answer": "Article 740 of the Civil Code (民法) governs the acceptance of marriage registration, stipulating that a registration cannot be accepted unless it complies with Articles 731, 732, 734–736, the second paragraph of the preceding article, and other laws and regulations.", "status": "answered", "score": {"cited": ["740", "731", "732", "734"], "invalid": [], "gold_hit": true, "gold_recall": 1.0, "extra": ["731", "732", "734"], "correct": true, "no_citation": false, "quotes": 0, "quotes_unsupported": 0}, "run": {"llm_calls": 8, "tool_calls": 3, "tokens_in": 7294, "tokens_out": 528, "tokens": 7822, "latency_s": 34.66672465800002, "errors": 0, "tool_failures": 0}, "calls": [{"node": "planner", "in": 110, "out": 84, "ms": 4587.368847000107}, {"node": "step.agent", "in": 954, "out": 54, "ms": 4632.230478000565}, {"node": "step.agent", "in": 1304, "out": 75, "ms": 4635.451338001076}, {"node": "step.agent", "in": 1021, "out": 40, "ms": 3127.621244999318}, {"node": "step.agent", "in": 1175, "out": 83, "ms": 4451.001162999091}, {"node": "step.agent", "in": 1106, "out": 41, "ms": 4174.7065509989625}, {"node": "step.agent", "in": 1261, "out": 83, "ms": 5123.538086998451}, {"node": "synth", "in": 363, "out": 68, "ms": 3924.6576280002046}], "tools": [{"node": "step", "name": "search_articles", "args": {"query": "婚姻の届出の受理", "law": "民法", "top_k": 5}, "ok": true}, {"node": "step", "name": "get_article", "args": {"law": "民法", "article": "740"}, "ok": true}, {"node": "step", "name": "get_article", "args": {"law": "Civil Code", "article": "740"}, "ok": true}], "verify": [], "errors": [], "prompts": "v2", "model": "qwen3.5:9b (Q4_K_M) via llama.cpp server"}
{"id": "dev001-ja", "item_id": "dev001", "arch": "plan_execute", "type": "topic", "language": "ja", "law": "民法", "gold": ["1003"], "anchor": [], "answer": "民法第 1002 条（民法）は、負担付遺贈の受遺者が遺贈を放棄した場合、その放棄の割合に応じて負担義務を免れることを定めています。", "status": "answered", "score": {"cited": ["1002"], "invalid": [], "gold_hit": false, "gold_recall": 0.0, "extra": ["1002"], "correct": false, "no_citation": false, "quotes": 0, "quotes_unsupported": 0}, "run": {"llm_calls": 8, "tool_calls": 3, "tokens_in": 7240, "tokens_out": 436, "tokens": 7676, "latency_s": 29.579694527001266, "errors": 0, "tool_failures": 0}, "calls": [{"node": "planner", "in": 116, "out": 90, "ms": 4950.472462000107}, {"node": "step.agent", "in": 973, "out": 60, "ms": 5116.888208998716}, {"node": "step.agent", "in": 1356, "out": 53, "ms": 3104.5782759993017}, {"node": "step.agent", "in": 1013, "out": 41, "ms": 3276.79142299894}, {"node": "step.agent", "in": 1195, "out": 43, "ms": 2886.291151000478}, {"node": "step.agent", "in": 1056, "out": 41, "ms": 3128.8499149995914}, {"node": "step.agent", "in": 1238, "out": 65, "ms": 4387.476335999963}, {"node": "synth", "in": 293, "out": 43, "ms": 2718.1962300001032}], "tools": [{"node": "step", "name": "search_articles", "args": {"query": "負担付遺贈 受遺者 免責", "law": "民法", "top_k": 5}, "ok": true}, {"node": "step", "name": "get_article", "args": {"law": "民法", "article": "1002"}, "ok": true}, {"node": "step", "name": "get_article", "args": {"law": "民法", "article": "1002"}, "ok": true}], "verify": [], "errors": [], "prompts": "v2", "model": "qwen3.5:9b (Q4_K_M) via llama.cpp server"}
{"id": "dev001-en", "item_id": "dev001", "arch": "plan_execute", "type": "topic", "language": "en", "law": "民法", "gold": ["1003"], "anchor": [], "answer": "Article 1002 of the Civil Code (民法第千二条) stipulates that a legatee of a legacy subject to a burden is liable only up to the value of the legacy and is exempt from the obligation if they renounce the legacy.", "status": "answered", "score": {"cited": ["1002"], "invalid": [], "gold_hit": false, "gold_recall": 0.0, "extra": ["1002"], "correct": false, "no_citation": false, "quotes": 0, "quotes_unsupported": 0}, "run": {"llm_calls": 8, "tool_calls": 3, "tokens_in": 7392, "tokens_out": 525, "tokens": 7917, "latency_s": 36.871919577999506, "errors": 0, "tool_failures": 0}, "calls": [{"node": "planner", "in": 114, "out": 108, "ms": 7222.928520999631}, {"node": "step.agent", "in": 970, "out": 58, "ms": 4697.6555379987985}, {"node": "step.agent", "in": 1350, "out": 75, "ms": 4691.962728000362}, {"node": "step.agent", "in": 1025, "out": 41, "ms": 3383.5402019994945}, {"node": "step.agent", "in": 1207, "out": 59, "ms": 2825.7884819995525}, {"node": "step.agent", "in": 1097, "out": 41, "ms": 3774.836831000357}, {"node": "step.agent", "in": 1279, "out": 89, "ms": 6408.067528000174}, {"node": "synth", "in": 350, "out": 54, "ms": 3855.5722430010064}], "tools": [{"node": "step", "name": "search_articles", "args": {"query": "負担付遺贈の受遺者の免責", "law": "民法", "top_k": 5}, "ok": true}, {"node": "step", "name": "get_article", "args": {"law": "民法", "article": "1002"}, "ok": true}, {"node": "step", "name": "get_article", "args": {"law": "民法", "article": "1002"}, "ok": true}], "verify": [], "errors": [], "prompts": "v2", "model": "qwen3.5:9b (Q4_K_M) via llama.cpp server"}
{"id": "dev002-ja", "item_id": "dev002", "arch": "plan_execute", "type": "topic", "language": "ja", "law": "民法", "gold": ["987"], "anchor": [], "answer": "民法第九百八十七条（民法）は、遺贈義務者や利害関係人が受遺者に催告できることを定めており、受遺者が期間内に意思を表示しない場合は遺贈を承認したものとみなすと規定しています。", "status": "answered", "score": {"cited": ["987"], "invalid": [], "gold_hit": true, "gold_recall": 1.0, "extra": [], "correct": true, "no_citation": false, "quotes": 0, "quotes_unsupported": 0}, "run": {"llm_calls": 8, "tool_calls": 3, "tokens_in": 7329, "tokens_out": 446, "tokens": 7775, "latency_s": 31.489542150999114, "errors": 0, "tool_failures": 0}, "calls": [{"node": "planner", "in": 118, "out": 72, "ms": 4942.855974999475}, {"node": "step.agent", "in": 963, "out": 60, "ms": 4154.181194000557}, {"node": "step.agent", "in": 1347, "out": 59, "ms": 3806.4266290002706}, {"node": "step.agent", "in": 1017, "out": 40, "ms": 3717.192071999307}, {"node": "step.agent", "in": 1211, "out": 63, "ms": 3887.2063960006926}, {"node": "step.agent", "in": 1080, "out": 40, "ms": 2769.983255000625}, {"node": "step.agent", "in": 1274, "out": 63, "ms": 4973.305101999358}, {"node": "synth", "in": 319, "out": 49, "ms": 3226.0354640002333}], "tools": [{"node": "step", "name": "search_articles", "args": {"query": "受遺者に対する遺贈の承認又は放棄の催告", "law": "民法", "top_k": 5}, "ok": true}, {"node": "step", "name": "get_article", "args": {"law": "民法", "article": "987"}, "ok": true}, {"node": "step", "name": "get_article", "args": {"law": "民法", "article": "987"}, "ok": true}], "verify": [], "errors": [], "prompts": "v2", "model": "qwen3.5:9b (Q4_K_M) via llama.cpp server"}
{"id": "dev002-en", "item_id": "dev002", "arch": "plan_execute", "type": "topic", "language": "en", "law": "民法", "gold": ["987"], "anchor": [], "answer": "Civil Code Article 987 (民法第九百八十七条) allows interested parties to demand that a legatee accept or renounce a legacy within a reasonable period, deeming the legacy accepted if the legatee fails to express their intention within that time.", "status": "answered", "score": {"cited": ["987"], "invalid": [], "gold_hit": true, "gold_recall": 1.0, "extra": [], "correct": true, "no_citation": false, "quotes": 0, "quotes_unsupported": 0}, "run": {"llm_calls": 8, "tool_calls": 3, "tokens_in": 7304, "tokens_out": 483, "tokens": 7787, "latency_s": 32.70291700099915, "errors": 0, "tool_failures": 0}, "calls": [{"node": "planner", "in": 116, "out": 106, "ms": 6816.592887000297}, {"node": "step.agent", "in": 976, "out": 60, "ms": 4531.435954000699}, {"node": "step.agent", "in": 1360, "out": 45, "ms": 3314.76526500046}, {"node": "step.agent", "in": 998, "out": 40, "ms": 2361.9506129998626}, {"node": "step.agent", "in": 1192, "out": 73, "ms": 4628.188053999111}, {"node": "step.agent", "in": 1077, "out": 40, "ms": 3123.9087649992143}, {"node": "step.agent", "in": 1271, "out": 66, "ms": 4576.801354000054}, {"node": "synth", "in": 314, "out": 53, "ms": 3336.0466260000976}], "tools": [{"node": "step", "name": "search_articles", "args": {"query": "受遺者に対する遺贈の承認又は放棄の催告", "law": "民法", "top_k": 5}, "ok": true}, {"node": "step", "name": "get_article", "args": {"law": "民法", "article": "987"}, "ok": true}, {"node": "step", "name": "get_article", "args": {"law": "民法", "article": "987"}, "ok": true}], "verify": [], "errors": [], "prompts": "v2", "model": "qwen3.5:9b (Q4_K_M) via llama.cpp server"}
{"id": "dev003-ja", "item_id": "dev003", "arch": "plan_execute", "type": "topic", "language": "ja", "law": "民法", "gold": ["395"], "anchor": [], "answer": "民法第 395 条（民法）は、抵当権者に対抗できない賃貸借で建物を使用する者は、競売の買受人が建物を取得してから 6 ヶ月間は引き渡しを猶予できると定めています（ただし、使用開始が買受人の取得後で代金を未払いの場合は適用除外）。", "status": "answered", "score": {"cited": ["395"], "invalid": [], "gold_hit": true, "gold_recall": 1.0, "extra": [], "correct": true, "no_citation": false, "quotes": 0, "quotes_unsupported": 0}, "run": {"llm_calls": 9, "tool_calls": 4, "tokens_in": 9273, "tokens_out": 661, "tokens": 9934, "latency_s": 43.807655124999656, "errors": 0, "tool_failures": 1}, "calls": [{"node": "planner", "in": 116, "out": 139, "ms": 8406.588727999406}, {"node": "step.agent", "in": 974, "out": 58, "ms": 4334.445157999653}, {"node": "step.agent", "in": 1319, "out": 40, "ms": 2533.005395998771}, {"node": "step.agent", "in": 1605, "out": 87, "ms": 5710.811419001402}, {"node": "step.agent", "in": 1058, "out": 40, "ms": 2868.8377350008523}, {"node": "step.agent", "in": 1129, "out": 109, "ms": 7310.946448000323}, {"node": "step.agent", "in": 1192, "out": 40, "ms": 3097.9433940010495}, {"node": "step.agent", "in": 1478, "out": 74, "ms": 5077.5138970002445}, {"node": "synth", "in": 402, "out": 74, "ms": 4455.6879329993535}], "tools": [{"node": "step", "name": "search_articles", "args": {"query": "抵当建物使用者の引渡しの猶予", "law": "民法", "top_k": 5}, "ok": true}, {"node": "step", "name": "get_article", "args": {"law": "民法", "article": "395"}, "ok": true}, {"node": "step", "name": "get_article", "args": {"law": "民法", "article": "363"}, "ok": false}, {"node": "step", "name": "get_article", "args": {"law": "民法", "article": "395"}, "ok": true}], "verify": [], "errors": [], "prompts": "v2", "model": "qwen3.5:9b (Q4_K_M) via llama.cpp server"}
{"id": "dev003-en", "item_id": "dev003", "arch": "plan_execute", "type": "topic", "language": "en", "law": "民法", "gold": ["395"], "anchor": [], "answer": "Article 395 of the Civil Code (民法 第三百九十五条) provides that a user of a mortgaged building under a non-opposable lease may request a six-month postponement of delivery to the auction purchaser if they were using the building before the auction or under a lease made by the auction manager.", "status": "answered", "score": {"cited": ["395"], "invalid": [], "gold_hit": true, "gold_recall": 1.0, "extra": [], "correct": true, "no_citation": false, "quotes": 0, "quotes_unsupported": 0}, "run": {"llm_calls": 8, "tool_calls": 3, "tokens_in": 7608, "tokens_out": 565, "tokens": 8173, "latency_s": 37.53928587500013, "errors": 0, "tool_failures": 0}, "calls": [{"node": "planner", "in": 114, "out": 87, "ms": 4744.294770000124}, {"node": "step.agent", "in": 962, "out": 58, "ms": 4681.230861999211}, {"node": "step.agent", "in": 1307, "out": 61, "ms": 3407.140215000254}, {"node": "step.agent", "in": 1005, "out": 40, "ms": 3325.0007970000297}, {"node": "step.agent", "in": 1291, "out": 107, "ms": 7481.767184999626}, {"node": "step.agent", "in": 1123, "out": 40, "ms": 3366.736691001279}, {"node": "step.agent", "in": 1409, "out": 107, "ms": 6217.840970999532}, {"node": "synth", "in": 397, "out": 65, "ms": 4304.875186000572}], "tools": [{"node": "step", "name": "search_articles", "args": {"query": "抵当建物使用者の引渡しの猶予", "law": "民法", "top_k": 5}, "ok": true}, {"node": "step", "name": "get_article", "args": {"law": "民法", "article": "395"}, "ok": true}, {"node": "step", "name": "get_article", "args": {"law": "民法", "article": "395"}, "ok": true}], "verify": [], "errors": [], "prompts": "v2", "model": "qwen3.5:9b (Q4_K_M) via llama.cpp server"}
{"id": "dev004-ja", "item_id": "dev004", "arch": "plan_execute", "type": "topic", "language": "ja", "law": "民法", "gold": ["264-9"], "anchor": [], "answer": "民法第 264 条の 9 は、所有者の不適切な管理により他人の権利が侵害される恐れがある場合、裁判所が利害関係人の請求により管理不全土地管理人を選任して管理を命ずる命令を発令できることを定めています。民法第 264 条の 10 は、この命令を受けた管理人が対象土地・動産の管理及び処分をできる権限を有し、保存行為や利用・改良行為には裁判所の許可が必要であることを定めています。", "status": "answered", "score": {"cited": ["264-9", "264-10"], "invalid": [], "gold_hit": true, "gold_recall": 1.0, "extra": ["264-10"], "correct": true, "no_citation": false, "quotes": 0, "quotes_unsupported": 0}, "run": {"llm_calls": 8, "tool_calls": 5, "tokens_in": 8277, "tokens_out": 695, "tokens": 8972, "latency_s": 44.44371599899932, "errors": 0, "tool_failures": 0}, "calls": [{"node": "planner", "in": 111, "out": 60, "ms": 4011.6924040012236}, {"node": "step.agent", "in": 957, "out": 53, "ms": 3670.3727790008998}, {"node": "step.agent", "in": 1321, "out": 87, "ms": 5281.071295999936}, {"node": "step.agent", "in": 1034, "out": 85, "ms": 5895.611177000319}, {"node": "step.agent", "in": 1589, "out": 110, "ms": 6164.980303001357}, {"node": "step.agent", "in": 1141, "out": 85, "ms": 4990.345708998575}, {"node": "step.agent", "in": 1696, "out": 104, "ms": 7531.617808999727}, {"node": "synth", "in": 428, "out": 111, "ms": 6887.267885998881}], "tools": [{"node": "step", "name": "search_articles", "args": {"query": "管理不全土地管理命令", "law": "民法", "top_k": 5}, "ok": true}, {"node": "step", "name": "get_article", "args": {"law": "民法", "article": "264-9"}, "ok": true}, {"node": "step", "name": "get_article", "args": {"law": "民法", "article": "264-10"}, "ok": true}, {"node": "step", "name": "get_article", "args": {"law": "民法", "article": "264-9"}, "ok": true}, {"node": "step", "name": "get_article", "args": {"law": "民法", "article": "264-10"}, "ok": true}], "verify": [], "errors": [], "prompts": "v2", "model": "qwen3.5:9b (Q4_K_M) via llama.cpp server"}
